{
  "schema_version": "3.0",
  "key": "basic_text_genres_messages_emails",
  "concept_slug": "basic_text_genres_messages_emails",
  "grounding_mode": "fallback_no_wiki",
  "title": "Short Norwegian Messages and Emails",
  "cefr_level": "A2",
  "goal": "Write a short Norwegian message or email with a suitable greeting, body, and sign-off.",
  "elements": [
    {
      "kind": "section",
      "role": "orient",
      "title": "The Basic Shape",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "spans": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "A short Norwegian message or email usually has three clear parts: a greeting, a brief body, and a sign-off. The body is the main message. A sign-off is the closing phrase before your name."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "rule",
          "statement": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "Use this simple order: greeting, short body, sign-off, name."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "example",
          "no": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "Hei Anna,\nKan vi møtes klokka fem?\nHilsen Tom"
            }
          ],
          "en": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "Hi Anna,\nCan we meet at five o'clock?\nRegards, Tom"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "spans": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "In very short messages, Norwegian often keeps the body direct and practical. You do not need a long introduction if the reader already knows the situation."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "example",
          "no": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "Hei.\nJeg er litt forsinket. Vi ses snart.\nHilsen Sara"
            }
          ],
          "en": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "Hi.\nI am a little delayed. See you soon.\nRegards, Sara"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "section",
      "role": "model",
      "title": "Greetings",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "spans": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "The greeting sets the tone. For everyday messages, "
            },
            {
              "kind": "foreign_term",
              "value": "Hei",
              "lang": "no"
            },
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": " is the safest common choice. "
            },
            {
              "kind": "foreign_term",
              "value": "Kjære",
              "lang": "no"
            },
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": " can sound warmer or more traditional, and it often fits letters, invitations, and personal emails."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "rule",
          "statement": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "Use "
            },
            {
              "kind": "foreign_term",
              "value": "Hei",
              "lang": "no"
            },
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": " for most neutral and friendly messages. Use "
            },
            {
              "kind": "foreign_term",
              "value": "Kjære",
              "lang": "no"
            },
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": " when you want a warmer written opening."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "example",
          "no": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "Hei Martin, takk for meldingen."
            }
          ],
          "en": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "Hi Martin, thanks for the message."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "example",
          "no": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "Kjære Ingrid, tusen takk for invitasjonen."
            }
          ],
          "en": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "Dear Ingrid, many thanks for the invitation."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "callout",
          "level": "tip",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "spans": [
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "value": "After a short greeting with a name, a comma is a common modern choice: Hei Anna, takk for meldingen. A line break after the greeting is also common in emails. A period is possible, but it can make a friendly message sound more clipped."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "section",
      "role": "model",
      "title": "The Short Body",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "spans": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "The body should do one clear job: ask, answer, thank, invite, or give a short update. Keep the sentences simple and put time or reason details only when they help the reader."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "rule",
          "statement": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "A useful body pattern is: reason or thanks, main message, small closing sentence."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "example",
          "no": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "Takk for e-posten. Jeg kan komme på fredag. Passer klokka ti?"
            }
          ],
          "en": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "Thanks for the email. I can come on Friday. Does ten o'clock work?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "example",
          "no": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "Jeg skriver fordi jeg har et spørsmål om timen. Kan du sende planen?"
            }
          ],
          "en": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "I am writing because I have a question about the lesson. Can you send the plan?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "spans": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "Messages and emails still use normal sentence word order. The finite verb usually comes early in the sentence. This lesson focuses on message shape, not on changing word order."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "section",
      "role": "contrast",
      "title": "Sign-offs",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "spans": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "The sign-off closes the message politely. "
            },
            {
              "kind": "foreign_term",
              "value": "Hilsen",
              "lang": "no"
            },
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": " is friendly and common. "
            },
            {
              "kind": "foreign_term",
              "value": "Vennlig hilsen",
              "lang": "no"
            },
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": " is polite and works well in emails to teachers, offices, and people you do not know well. "
            },
            {
              "kind": "foreign_term",
              "value": "Mvh",
              "lang": "no"
            },
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": " is a common abbreviation for "
            },
            {
              "kind": "foreign_term",
              "value": "Med vennlig hilsen",
              "lang": "no"
            },
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": " and is often used in practical emails."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "rule",
          "statement": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "Choose "
            },
            {
              "kind": "foreign_term",
              "value": "Hilsen",
              "lang": "no"
            },
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": " for friendly messages, and "
            },
            {
              "kind": "foreign_term",
              "value": "Vennlig hilsen",
              "lang": "no"
            },
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": " or "
            },
            {
              "kind": "foreign_term",
              "value": "Mvh",
              "lang": "no"
            },
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": " for polite emails."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "example",
          "no": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "Hilsen Nora"
            }
          ],
          "en": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "Regards, Nora"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "example",
          "no": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "Vennlig hilsen Ahmed"
            }
          ],
          "en": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "Kind regards, Ahmed"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "example",
          "no": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "Mvh Elise"
            }
          ],
          "en": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "Kind regards, Elise"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "section",
      "role": "recap",
      "title": "Put It Together",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "spans": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "A complete short email can be very simple. The important thing is that the reader can see the opening, the message, and the closing."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "example",
          "no": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "Hei Fatima, takk for hjelpen i dag. Jeg sender dokumentet i morgen. Vennlig hilsen Lars"
            }
          ],
          "en": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "Hi Fatima, thanks for the help today. I will send the document tomorrow. Kind regards, Lars"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "list",
          "ordered": true,
          "items": [
            [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "Start with a greeting such as "
              },
              {
                "kind": "foreign_term",
                "value": "Hei",
                "lang": "no"
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": " or "
              },
              {
                "kind": "foreign_term",
                "value": "Kjære",
                "lang": "no"
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "."
              }
            ],
            [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "Write one to three clear body sentences."
              }
            ],
            [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "End with "
              },
              {
                "kind": "foreign_term",
                "value": "Hilsen",
                "lang": "no"
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": ", "
              },
              {
                "kind": "foreign_term",
                "value": "Vennlig hilsen",
                "lang": "no"
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": ", or "
              },
              {
                "kind": "foreign_term",
                "value": "Mvh",
                "lang": "no"
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": ", plus your name."
              }
            ]
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
